          "body": "The volume of one hemisphere of radius \\(r\\) is\n\n\\[\n\\frac23\\pi r^3\n\\]"
        },
        {
          "title": "Solid A is the frustum",
          "body": "Solid A is the frustum plus one hemisphere:\n\n\\[\nV_A=\\frac13\\pi r^2h(k^3-1)+\\frac23\\pi r^3\n\\]"
        },
        {
          "title": "Solid B is the small",
          "body": "Solid B is the small cone plus one hemisphere:\n\n\\[\nV_B=\\frac13\\pi r^2h+\\frac23\\pi r^3\n\\]"
        },
        {
          "title": "Given",
          "body": "Given \\(V_A=6V_B\\):\n\n\\[\n\\frac13\\pi r^2h(k^3-1)+\\frac23\\pi r^3\n=6\\left(\\frac13\\pi r^2h+\\frac23\\pi r^3\\right)\n\\]"
        },
