        {
          "title": "Use the common denominator",
          "body": "Use the common denominator \\((x-6)(x+6)\\):\n\n\\[\n\\frac{20-2(x+6)}{(x-6)(x+6)}\n\\]\n\n\\[\n=\\frac{20-2x-12}{(x-6)(x+6)}\n\\]\n\n\\[\n=\\frac{8-2x}{(x-6)(x+6)}\n\\]\n\n\\[\n=\\frac{-2(x-4)}{(x-6)(x+6)}\n\\]"
        },
